{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-08", "prepared_on": "2026-11-08", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-08</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI valued at $1.25 trillion, as rival Anthropic nears its IPO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 估值達 1.25 兆美元，對手 Anthropic 也逼近 IPO</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI raised another $11 billion at a $1.25 trillion valuation, according to Bloomberg, up from $852 billion in March.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">根據彭博報導，OpenAI 新一輪再募得 110 億美元，估值達 1.25 兆美元，3 月時為 8,520 億美元。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1029380/openai-1-25-trillion-investment-valuation\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Why a new report on Anthropic automating AI development is alarming researchers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 以 AI 自動化 AI 開發的新報告為何讓研究人員警惕</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A METR report says Anthropic's models are improving roughly twice as fast as a year ago, with little sign of slowing down.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI 安全研究機構 METR 的報告指出，Anthropic 模型的進步速度約為一年前的兩倍，且看不出放緩跡象。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1029126/anthropic-metr-report-accelerating-ai-development\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Linux kernel IPv4 TCP vulnerability widely affects systems, vendors release patches<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Linux核心IPv4 TCP連線漏洞影響廣泛，多家廠商陸續推出修補</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Critical flaw CVE-2026-98432 (CVSS 9.8) in the Linux kernel's IPv4 TCP handling may allow remote code execution. Anthropic disclosed that Claude wrote an exploit for it.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Linux 核心網路子系統的 9.8 分重大漏洞 CVE-2026-98432 可能導致遠端程式碼執行，Anthropic 揭露 Claude 曾寫出利用程式，各家廠商陸續釋出修補。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180298\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> China reportedly recruited AI exec to spy on Jensen Huang<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳中國招募 AI 高階主管監視黃仁勳</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Per The New York Times, China's MSS enlisted Megaspeed executive Alice Huang to gather intel on American AI chips and possibly influence Nvidia.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據紐約時報報導，中國國家安全部招募 Megaspeed 高階主管 Alice Huang，蒐集美國 AI 晶片情報，並可能影響 Nvidia。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1029338/nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-china-spy\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> The US let Nvidia sell chips to an empty office in China<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">美國讓 Nvidia 把晶片賣給中國一間空辦公室</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The NYT reports that New Matrix, on the approved list to handle H200 chips, has empty offices, raising doubts about vetting by Commerce and Nvidia.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">紐約時報指出，獲准處理 H200 晶片的 New Matrix 辦公室空無一人，外界質疑商務部與 Nvidia 的審查是否確實。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1029483/nvidia-ai-chips-china-blacklist-government\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> OpenSSH releases emergency update fixing SSHole authentication bypass via long passwords<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenSSH發布緊急更新，修補可利用長密碼繞過身分驗證的資安漏洞SSHole</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenSSH 10.6p2 fixes SSHole (CVE-2026-123158), an authentication bypass triggered by long passwords, rooted in how OpenSSH interacts with the musl C library.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenSSH 於 11 月 5 日發布緊急更新 10.6p2，修補可用長密碼繞過驗證的 SSHole 漏洞，成因在於 OpenSSH 與 musl C 程式庫的密碼驗證處理。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180281\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Anthropic launches Claude Personal Finance, linking bank accounts to analyze spending<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic推出Claude個人理財功能，可連結銀行帳戶分析收支</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic announced Claude Personal Finance, letting users connect bank and credit card accounts for AI analysis, following OpenAI's ChatGPT offering in May.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">繼 OpenAI 今年 5 月推出 ChatGPT 個人理財後，Anthropic 也推出 Claude Personal Finance，可連結銀行與信用卡帳戶分析收支。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180268\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Ramp data shows AI spending stalling just as Anthropic nears its IPO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Ramp 數據顯示 AI 支出停滯，恰逢 Anthropic 接近 IPO</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI usage keeps climbing but spending has stalled, as price cuts and smarter cost controls could challenge investor assumptions about hypergrowth.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI 使用量持續上升，但支出已停滯；降價與更精明的成本控管可能挑戰投資人對超高成長的假設。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/ramp-data-shows-ai-spending-stalling-just-as-anthropic-nears-its-ipo/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> After the midterms, data centers face tougher politics: voters backed more limits<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">期中選舉後，資料中心面臨更嚴峻的政治環境：選民支持更多限制</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Voters weighed in on 41 data center ballot measures, and all but one favored more restrictions on development.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">選民就 41 項資料中心相關公投表態，除一項外，多數都投票支持對資料中心開發施加更多限制。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/podcast/how-a-blue-wave-midterm-might-reshape-the-ai-industry/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Palo Alto Networks in talks to buy AI agent security startup Clutch for $500M<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Palo Alto Networks 洽談以 5 億美元收購 AI 代理安全新創 Clutch</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Clutch, backed by Lightspeed and SignalFire, was last valued at $85 million, according to a source.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">由 Lightspeed 與 SignalFire 支持的 Clutch，上一輪估值為 8,500 萬美元，消息人士透露。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/palo-alto-networks-in-talks-to-buy-ai-agent-security-startup-clutch-for-500m/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}